WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.054
Tax dates live in your head, tasks live in three different places,

00:00:07.054 --> 00:00:10.125
and a saving you could still make is easy to miss.

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:13.305
Every number, traced to its page.

00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:16.206
The Overview is where taxtrace opens.

00:00:16.206 --> 00:00:20.776
At the top: how many documents the workspace holds, which tax years,

00:00:20.776 --> 00:00:24.068
how many filed returns it can carry forward from,

00:00:24.068 --> 00:00:26.420
and how many chat models are ready.

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:32.182
Below, your to-do list, grouped by when each item is due.

00:00:32.182 --> 00:00:34.507
It is a plain file in your workspace,

00:00:34.507 --> 00:00:37.775
and ticking an item here marks it done in that file.

00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:44.152
Then the year's moves, ranked by what each saves.

00:00:44.152 --> 00:00:47.358
Each one says what to do, how much, and by when.

00:00:47.358 --> 00:00:50.830
The first tile is what could still come off the tax.
